category: Science
build-depends: cygport libhdf5-devel liblapack-devel
sdesc: "Spin-adapted implementation of DMRG for ab initio quantum chemistry (utilities)"
ldesc: "CheMPS2 is a scientific library which contains a spin-adapted implementation
of the density matrix renormalization group (DMRG) for ab initio quantum
chemistry."
